🇳🇱 A robot called Aletta is now drawing blood completely on its own.

Using AI and ultrasound, it finds the vein, inserts the needle, takes the blood, removes the needle, and puts on a bandage. No human hands required. Up to 98% patients said they would do it again. It's already being used in several Dutch hospitals.

